bash is a shell for the Unix/Linux command line. A little on the  
order of DOS, if you've never used a command line before, except  
quite a bit more powerful. And, most evident to new users, DOS uses a  
lot of all upper case while bash and its relatives use a lot of all  
lower case.

See also http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bash

